settings-terminal-sessions = Sessions
settings-terminal-restore = Restore terminal tabs after a restart
settings-terminal-restore-about = Each tab's last screen, folder and environment are kept in the IDE's data folder, readable only by you. After the computer restarts, or when the terminal host stopped, the tabs open again with the old output dimmed and a new shell, and offer to run the last command again; nothing runs by itself. Turning this off removes what was kept.
